# Every page of the web app asks for its own agent cluster, so Chrome puts it in a process of its own: a game frame busy
# loading never freezes the store page around it. Pages may only be framed by the platform itself (clickjacking of
# sign-in, purchase and consent buttons). The Worker adds the same headers to the pages it renders itself (src/index.ts).
/*
  Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
